); height: 15px; width: 12.5836%; padding: 10px !important;\">5.5*2.1</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: rgb(173, 173, 173); height: 15px; width: 13.1387%; padding: 10px !important;\">165mm</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: rgb(173, 173, 173); height: 15px; width: 15.1743%; padding: 10px !important;\">24V DC</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: rgb(173, 173, 173); height: 15px; width: 18.1101%; padding: 10px !important;\">12mm</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: rgb(173, 173, 173); height: 15px; width: 8.90757%; padding: 10px !important;\">22#</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Installation </h2>\n<p> </p>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse aspect-video max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/7cbaa17fa03945259ba852879c08409e/Frame_1123862468_568708ef-371a-4ef9-8e5d-07035c6195ea.png\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><br/></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Consideration</h2>\n<p> </p>\n<ul>\n<li>Always disconnect power before installation.</li>\n<li>Do not connect to power adapters exceeding 24V to prevent potential damage or safety risks.</li>\n<li>Keep out of reach of children. This product is not a toy and should be handled responsibly.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>",
  "description_text": "The DC5521 Female to 2-Pin Solderless Quick Connector offers a simple and efficient power solution for the White CCT Tunable COB LED Strip Light. Designed for convenience, it features a solder-free connector on one end for effortless attachment to the LED strip, and a DC plug on the other end for seamless connection to a 24V AC-to-DC power adapter. This connector makes completing your illuminated DIY projects easier and more efficient than ever.\n\nAlways disconnect power before installation.\n\nDo not connect to power adapters exceeding 24V to prevent potential damage or safety risks.\n\nKeep out of reach of children. This product is not a toy and should be handled responsibly.",
